Z||000004||stimpy||01-20-2001||01:17 PM||||Yep, you need Plus to do AL's method. Unfortunately we're stuck with Classic. All of my pics I have had emailed to me from a puter, then I just forward them to my Photopoint account. First step is to set up your account, then get yer pics.||||reg||1
