Z||000006||stimpy||01-20-2001||08:09 PM||||Naw, it's free.  You can use them to develop your film and they will post the pics directly to your albums, also they sell mugs and mousepads and crap like that. That's where they make $.  But just have a friend email you the pics as a jpeg or gif and forward it to photopoint.  Don't send as bitmap or as zip files. WebTV to STOOPID for that. ||||reg||1
